{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rinth is an old school dungeon rpg inspired by 90s dungeon crawlers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter the dungeons, face different monsters and bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">chill mouse only gameplay</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Collect weapons</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">buy and sell weapons to merchants</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">craft weapons on anvil (3 same rarity weapons will create a better one)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">make decisions when to buy/sell and craft items</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dungeons</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">random generated dungeons</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">total 5 different dungeons, (10 levels each dungeon)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After beating all 50 levels you can do endless dungeons (has bosses too)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Playtime</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rinth is a short game, around 4-5 hours to complete everything</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Style</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy pixel graphics and listen great 16-bit music during the game</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Can you save the world from evil?</i></strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2738530?t=1748373814","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738530/83b490b0f6000bc36cf58e67